  "text": "I have chosen a relaxed yet polished look for your workday in the office. The striped t-shirt with 'change' embroidered on it adds a subtle, modern touch without being too casual, while the khaki shorts provide a comfortable base that is easy to move in throughout your day. The camel-colored plimsolls offer a stylish contrast to the earthy tones of your top and bottom, keeping you grounded but looking put-together. Finally, the yellow woven bag brings a pop of color and texture to complete the outfit.",
