      "n": "#72·27",
      "text": "This is a comfortable white t-shirt featuring fine beige horizontal stripes and the word 'change' embroidered in black script across the chest. The relaxed fit allows for easy movement during your office hours."
    },
    {
      "n": "#140·27",
      "text": "These are khaki shorts with an elasticated waistband, designed to offer a soft and comfortable fit that pairs perfectly with the top."
    },
    {
      "n": "#150·08",
      "text": "The MALLOW plimsolls in camel are crafted with a smooth upper and a chunky ribbed sole for extra height and comfort, bridging the gap between casual sneakers and polished footwear."
    },
    {
